    <DataNode elementId="MONOMER-11633" textLabel="gibberellin 20-oxidase" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="Q8RVF5" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="883.9586181640625" centerY="798.4854125976562" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">The &lt;i&gt;Oryza sativa SD1&lt;/i&gt; gene encodes for a gibberellin (GA) 20-oxidase (OsGA20ox-2), which catalyzes the successive oxidation of GA&lt;sub&gt;53&lt;/sub&gt; to GA&lt;sub&gt;20&lt;/sub&gt; via GA&lt;sub&gt;44&lt;/sub&gt; and GA&lt;sub&gt;19&lt;/sub&gt; |CITS:[11961544]|. Rice &lt;i&gt;sd1&lt;/i&gt; seedlings deficient in OsGA20ox-2 were shown to be depleted of the GA&lt;sub&gt;20&lt;/sub&gt; intermediate while accumulating GA&lt;sub&gt;53&lt;/sub&gt; |CITS:[11961544]|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="MONOMER-11633" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Prosite" value="PS51471" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Prints" value="PR00682" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Pfam" value="PF14226" />
